WEBVTT

video-title-observation
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Nlele na nyocha na-ebuwanye ihe

observation-01
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:09.700
Lelee gburugburu anya, mkpuchi anya na anya. Chọọ ihe na-adịghị mma.

observation-02
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Jiri nlele na-ebuwanye ihe. Tọọ Arclight ka ìhè ya sie ike karịa.

observation-03
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.500
Debe ngwaọrụ nso anya gị. Bịaruo anya nri onye ọrịa nwayọọ ruo mgbe ọ doro anya.

observation-04
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.500
Gwa ya ka o lee aka nri, mesịa aka ekpe.

observation-05
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.800
Jide mkpuchi anya nwayọọ. Gwa ya ka o lee elu na ala. Lelee akụkụ ndị ị na-ahụ n'ìgwè.

structures-01
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Nke mbụ: nku anya na oke mkpuchi anya elu na ala.

structures-02
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.450
Nke abụọ: conjunctiva na sclera,

structures-03
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.100
tinyere akpa dị n'okpuru.

structures-04
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.900
Nke atọ: cornea,

structures-05
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:19.400
na njikọ ya na sclera, limbus,

structures-06
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.700
na oghere ojii anya nke iris gbara gburugburu.

conditions-01
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Ndị a bụ foto ọrịa dị iche iche. Wepụta oge jiri Arclight nyochaa.

video-title-chamber-depth
00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:45.800
Omimi ime ụlọ ihu anya

chamber-depth-01
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.850
Ime ụlọ ihu anya dị n'etiti cornea na iris.

chamber-depth-02
00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:53.000
Tinye ìhè site n'akụkụ ntị iji lelee omimi ime ụlọ ihu anya.

chamber-depth-03
00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.100
Onyinyo n'akụkụ imi: omimi nwere ike ịdị nta. Ziga.

video-title-fluorescein
00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:04.100
Iji fluorescein tee cornea agba

fluorescein-application
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:09.600
Tinye fluorescein n'anya na mpempe ya ma ọ bụ Minims.

fluorescein-01
00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:14.000
Jiri ìhè anụnụ anụnụ lelee cornea.

fluorescein-02
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:23.500
Ebe elu akpụkpọ furu efu na ebe ọrịa ga-apụta. Dee ebe ha nọ na nha ha.

video-title-lid-eversion
00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:30.367
Ịtụgharị mkpuchi anya elu

lid-eversion-grip
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:36.700
Jiri mkpịsị aka ukwu na nke na-esote ya jide nku anya elu nwayọọ.

lid-eversion-01
00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:42.200
Tinye osisi owu n'elu mkpuchi anya, jiri ya kwado ya ka ị tụgharịa ya elu.

lid-eversion-02
00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:47.700
Jide mkpuchi ka ọ tụgharịrị. Lelee ime ya na anya nkịtị.

lid-eversion-03
00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:51.400
Weta Arclight nso ka i lee ya ibu.
